{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟工程師罕見地承認，開發 Windows 11 原生應用曾經非常困難，以至於不少開發者轉向跨平台框架，甚至乾脆放棄為 Windows 開發應用。在 Ignite 2026 大會上，微軟展示了新的 WinApp CLI 與 AI 代理工具，同時坦承 WinUI 仍存在大量缺陷和性能問題。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587920.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T06:43:53.604403+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T06:30:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T06:37:13.741601+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T06:37:13.741601+00:00","content_hash":"9cd2ab478d1550b2a585a8b4a6471ef90f95a065a14226965e63463f4b3472d3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}